# Files in this repo that are NOT part of the published site.
#
# The site is three files (index.html, app.js, styles.css) plus the fonts it
# links. Everything else here is documentation for whoever works on it, and a
# deploy that hands the folder to the host uploads whatever is in it — measured:
# the first Pages deployment of this repo served /README.md and /DESIGN.md as
# pages anyone could read. Neither is a secret, but neither is the site.
#
# Read by Misc/pages-stage.mjs, which copies the repo through these rules before
# `wrangler pages deploy` uploads it. It lives in the repo rather than in the
# deploy command so the repo itself says what it publishes.
README.md
DESIGN.md
